  "result": "**Where:** In the Domain project (`backend/src/InvoiceApp.Domain`), not the controller. The rules go in `ApprovalPolicy`, a pure function of values that never receives or writes an `Invoice`. The limits go in `ApprovalLimits`. `ApprovalService` loads the invoice, asks the policy, and writes only after every rule passes.\n\n**Refusal response:** The controller maps a refused approval to HTTP 403 with a JSON body `{ error, code }`. The `error` text names the rule, role, limit and invoice.\n\n**Current state:** `ApprovalPolicy` and `ApprovalLimits` don't exist yet. `ApprovalService.cs` is the only approval class in Domain, and `ApprovalsController.cs` is the Api side.",
